        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa is glad to see Amiya asleep."
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya did not see the Doctor's betrayal, nor Theresa's final bout of sorrow."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Black Crown finally lands neatly in Amiya's hands as Theresa takes down the final assassin in the room."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright, Amiya. Everything's fine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa does not look at the one frozen in place before her. She gently pats the back of the child in her arms and leaves a kiss on her puerile cheek."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa. I can't throw away this opportunity I spent millions of lives and myriads of years to reach.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't let you ruin the plan for Originium. I can't... let you turn this great land into a beautiful but fleeting dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's why you put Amiya in harm's way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Seeing as the King of Sarkaz has already seen my memories, I believe there's no need for any further explanation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you hate me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You hurt Amiya. You're about to hurt Kal'tsit, and the fighters who trust you so deeply.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this how you treat those lives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll do what I can to ensure their safety in the ensuing conflict. This is what Theresis swore to me as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "We only... need you to die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... did you present yourself before me out of guilt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guilt... is too light of a word, compared to everything I've done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "We made too many choices in a time that even Kal'tsit isn't familiar with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Amiya grows up, if she remembers me, if she asks about me, will you tell her the truth... of how I left her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll help them search for another way to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll help them search for a final moment of peace before Originium destroys Terra?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry... That's the one thing that's set in stone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know it's futile... and yet you still wish to cure Amiya's sickness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if her family and homeland will all turn into the same hunks of Originium in the not-too-distant future, along with anyone and anything you'll ever know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still don't want the girl before your eyes to suffer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what you sincerely feel. Your purest thoughts. Your innate nature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And actually... I'm glad, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad you're real and true\u2014the one who Kal'tsit willingly trusts, and in turn trusts us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... the creator of Originium... {@nickname}. You are the poison that ruins everything, but also the antidote to it all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_048"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doctor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothtrailground",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa strains to stand up, stretching her arms towards the Doctor, instilling in the latter an instinctive urge to retreat."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor tries to move, but fails. Sorrow far surpasses the collapsing rationality at this moment."
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa touches the face beneath the mask."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You're crying, Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, that's the kind of person you are. You know your own fragility, you know how much of a threat I pose to you even at a time like this... and yet... you still came here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, I still... am willing to believe in you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "To trust in who you really are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "To trust in our {@nickname} who brings the rain, dew, and sun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
