    {
        "text": "This face is both familiar and strange. Theresa knows its features well."
    },
    {
        "text": "She never had a chance to directly perceive the emotions on it until now."
    },
    {
        "text": "She smiles and stretches out her finger, snipping the scene before her into two, as if it were made of cloth."
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, she slowly pulls out a loose thread from the rift, and the remnants unravel as the Doctor's memories dissipate."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
